{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"748067231564300358","content":"So I have thought about this topic, and instead of saying \"what levels should they start and end at\" I think what we need to looks at is 3rd level slots/extra attack levels, and ending spell slots.\n\nso we have 5 weks, 3 before intermission and 2 after.  so getting really cool stuff then going on the break wont be as fun for the players, as getting to use those cool toys immediately.\n\nSo if we are wanting just a bit more power this season than last, we aim for end of week 2 to give them level 5, which means they have 4th levels slots for week 5 too (another major level).  the downside is, they wont get to hit level 8, unless we break with tradition, and on the last thursday, they get a level up, so the final event they get a second feat\n\nStart: 3\nend of w1: 4\nend of w2: 5\nend of w3: 6\nintermission\nend of w4: 7\nend of the second to last day of w5: 8","created_at":"2020-08-26T20:50:49.149000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"748283333544509480","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
